    "innovation": "This paper uses idealized climate model experiments to separate the climatic impacts of Arctic sea ice loss from insolation forcing, demonstrating that sea ice loss was a key driver of asymmetric winter warming and weakened atmospheric circulation during the mid-Holocene.",
