            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "In particular, polar stratospheric warming, a negative Arctic Oscillation (AO)-like weakening of mid-high latitude westerlies, and a slight cooling over Central-East Asia appear robustly in the climate model simulations.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
